{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House and Hand is a match-3 puzzle roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place forests, mountains, cities, and more on islands. Match three to evolve bigger and better features. Gain new powers and discover game-changing policies to create high-scoring synergies. Earn enough points and sail to the next island! <br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Match-3 Roguelike -</strong> Match 3 or more to earn points in this unique match-3 roguelike where every run offers fresh challenges with unique ways to strategically build your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/f2e438425247a435fe4d7c88d04b2513.poster.avif?t=1771700029\" width=792 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/f2e438425247a435fe4d7c88d04b2513.webm?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/f2e438425247a435fe4d7c88d04b2513.mp4?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Effect Cards</strong> - Earn impactful effect cards that can earn you more points, eliminate obstacles or hoard more gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/ab1242b732cc26d88027a7a0bd8793ad.poster.avif?t=1771700029\" width=792 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/ab1242b732cc26d88027a7a0bd8793ad.webm?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/ab1242b732cc26d88027a7a0bd8793ad.mp4?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Policies -</strong> Discover game-changing policies that change the rules and transform how you play. Stack synergies and build powerful scoring combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/af9ddaa6fc32586b2351a4918a4e7a63.poster.avif?t=1771700029\" width=1170 height=842 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/af9ddaa6fc32586b2351a4918a4e7a63.webm?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/af9ddaa6fc32586b2351a4918a4e7a63.mp4?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong> - After every round, choose between two islands that come with modifiers that can either help or hinder your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/09fd8f810612cf4e4e09ec5a90aea44b.poster.avif?t=1771700029\" width=1170 height=764 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/09fd8f810612cf4e4e09ec5a90aea44b.webm?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/extras/09fd8f810612cf4e4e09ec5a90aea44b.mp4?t=1771700029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Building Meets Puzzles -</strong> Watch humble settlements grow into bustling metropolises as you cleverly arrange and match your features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up and Play -</strong> Perfect for quick sessions or longer puzzle marathons. Each run delivers satisfying progression without demanding huge time commitments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Pixel Art -</strong> Vibrant, colorful islands come alive with cute buildings and a delightful pixel art aesthetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the perfect balance of strategy and luck in this match-3 puzzle game. With countless Policy combinations, cards to purchase, and endless replayability, no two runs are ever the same.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029960?t=1771700029","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/ff7a4eb0853538e623a0ba546fc90894fce2a7cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771700029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/3a05379eca9d7be371c7c36fc34de61663499c21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771700029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029960/3a05379eca9d7be371c7c36fc34de61663499c21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771700029","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4410420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House and Hand is a match-3 puzzle roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place forests, mountains, cities, and more on islands. Match three to evolve bigger and better features. Gain new powers and discover game-changing policies to create high-scoring synergies. Earn enough points and sail to the next island! <br><br><strong>